  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "高等資源管理與空間資訊發展特論",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPICS ON ADVANCED RESOURCE MANAGEMENT AND SPATIAL INFORMATION DEVELOPMENT",
    "describe_ch": "環境資源保育與永續利用管理課題之研究與探討，透過環境資源理論說明與分析各地區重要資源管理系統開發案例，將理論與實務徹底結合，資源管理包括資源環境狀況、動態變化、開發監督、治理與跟蹤等方面，結合GIS、RS、GPS等空間資訊技術，探討資源管理之應用議題。並深入介紹台灣地區之產、官、學等公私部門如何應用管理系統之軟、硬技術於環境資源開發與保育等相關學理與實作，以培養學生具備環境資源利用與保育平衡之環境永續經營管理知識與能力之目標。",
    "describe_eh": "This class focus on monographic of up-to-date geospatial model and the application trends for environmental conservation and sustainable management issues which include model-based analysis and the latest geospatial technologies . Students can build up the ability or skill to integrate and implement for keeping balance between the environment development and conservational management by field study and demonstration from public or private department agencies.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
